                "details": [
                    "[Passive] Nerf -> Sling: Movement speed reduced.",
                    "[Tactical] Nerf -> Whistler: Reduced delay before an overheated weapon starts cooling down to 1s (was 2s), Reduced how long it takes an overheated weapon to cooldown to 8s (was 12s)"
                ]
            }
        ],
